4
00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:17.490
Today we learn about Fighting Antibiotic Resistance. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.808 --> 00:00:25.842
Antimicrobial resistance. Say it with me. Antimicrobial resistance!

6
00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:33.594
Superbugs. Say it with me. Superbugs!

7
00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:41.167
Prescription. Say it with me. Prescription!

8
00:00:44.656 --> 00:00:48.573
Livestock. Say it with me. Livestock!

9
00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:57.156
Infection prevention. Say it with me. Infection prevention!

10
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.314
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

11
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:11.541
Research. Say it with me. Research!

12
00:01:15.018 --> 00:01:18.451
Global. Say it with me. Global!

13
00:01:21.977 --> 00:01:37.199
Antimicrobial resistance creates superbugs that are hard to treat. Using antibiotics only by prescription, limiting misuse in livestock, infection prevention, hygiene, and research are global priorities.

14
